Newsgroups: soc.culture.canada,can.politics,can.general
From: pkern@utcs.utoronto.ca (pkern)
Subject:  U of Toronto reaction
Message-ID: <1992Jun16.045026.15800@gpu.utcs.utoronto.ca>
