Subject: Usenet Policy
                                                                  
                                                 
At the last meeting of Computer Council, a draft Usenet Policy
based on the discussions at the March 18 meeting of CUC was
discussed.  Several changes were proposed, including the
removal of reference to "offensive" material, incorporation of a
possible referral to legal assistance, and a reference in the
preamble to the legal concerns that are part of the motivation
for this policy.  I have also taken this opportunity to clean up
